423	/****************************************************************************
424	 * Name: lib_filesistream_open, lib_filesistream_close,
425	 *       lib_fileoutstream_open, lib_fileoutstream_close
426	 *
427	 * Description:
428	 *   Initializes or release a file-based stream instance.
429	 *   Defined in lib_fileinstream.c and lib/lib_fileoutstream.c
430	 *
431	 * Input Parameters:
432	 *  For open:
433	 *    stream  - User allocated, uninitialized instance of stream struct
434	 *             to be initialized.
435	 *    path    - Path to the file to be opened.
436	 *    oflag   - File open flags.
437	 *    mode    - File access mode.
438	 *  For close:
439	 *    stream  - User allocated, initialized instance of stream struct
440	 * Returned Value:
441	 *  open: Zero on success; a negated errno value on failure.
442	 *  close: None (resource cleanup only).
443	 *
444	 ****************************************************************************/
